rd without committing more chips to a potentially losing hand\n4. I can control the pot size and gather information about opponent's strength based on their action\n5. I'm already winning overall, so there's no need to take excessive risks on a marginal spot\n6. If opponent checks behind, I get a free card; if they bet, I can reassess with more information\n\nAnswer: 0"}
